# W6-05-05 / W6-05-04: the bottom-right timer stack [RE: TacticalClass draw
# FUN_006a45a0 -> FUN_006a5280]. Every ShowTimer=yes superweapon of EVERY
# house that has started charging is listed "<UIName>  mm:ss" in its owner's colour, right-aligned at
# the bottom-right of the tactical view, stacking upward.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
assert timer_lines == 0                                  @W6-05-05
cheat w2 build GAPOWR
cheat w2 build GAPOWR
cheat place GAWEAT 0 building 0:GACNST +8 -6
cheat place NAPOWR 1 building 0:GACNST +14 -2
cheat place NAPOWR 1 building 0:GACNST +17 -2
cheat place NAMISL 1 building 0:GACNST +14 -6
until 60 timer_lines == 2                                @W6-05-05
wait 30
dump
view building 0:GACNST
shot timers
end
